stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Initialize
  Initialize --> Agent

  Agent --> Tools: if tool_calls
  Tools --> Agent: tool_results

  Agent --> ParseOutput: if no tool_calls
  ParseOutput --> Complete: report_text present
  ParseOutput --> FallbackSynthesis: empty_output or MALFORMED_FUNCTION_CALL
  FallbackSynthesis --> Complete: direct synthesis success

  Agent --> Error: runtime exception
  Error --> [*]
  Complete --> [*]
